From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ReaperOfVeriod <oeps46@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 14:00:46 +0000
Subject: big modded levels

Let a modded level use more than 32 MiB.

With OPENRAC_HAS_DISC (the port), the level heap checks (CHECK_LEVEL_HEAP) and the expanded
arena's own file-order moby map (EXPANDED_LEVEL_RAM, true only above 32 MiB of guest RAM, a
modded level's). Without it EXPANDED_LEVEL_RAM is 0 and CHECK_LEVEL_HEAP nothing, so the PS2
build compiles the added branch away.
